  m_text: "You have arrived in Ancient Egypt.\nDeep within the lost labyrinth of
    Hawara lies the Staff of Sobekneferu, an ancient artifact needed to repair your
    time machine. The pyramid is unstable and dangerous. \nPatrol dogs roam the corridors,
    and only those who master the path can reach the final chamber. \nYou have 5
    minutes. \nNavigate the labyrinth. \nComplete parkour challenges. \nFind the
    key to unlock the final chamber. \nRetrieve the staff\u2026 before time runs
    out."
